      "text": "class Maze(Grid[RoomData]):\n___________________________________________________________\nWill have maze specific logic here and maze specific\nattributes\n\n----------------------------------------------------------\n(attributes)\n\nexit: Room[RoomData]\nentrance: Room[RoomData]",
