      "versionNonce": 121477566,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790953136347,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class Room(Cell[RoomData])\n__________________________________________\nWill redefine valid property from base class\nCell[T]\nAdds 'room within grid'- related methods like\nproperty(surrounded), break_wall\n \nWill use most of the \ndefault implementation of Cell[T]\nWill add property(surrounded), break_wall(w: Wall)\n-------------------------------------------------\n-------------------------------------------------\n+ property(valid): bool\n+ property(surrounded): list[T]\n+ break_wall(w: Wall): None\n+ property(is_exit): bool\n    return self._grid.exit == (self.y, self.x)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "8mYjum0sH1zW4I4mMr-YK",
      "originalText": "class Room(Cell[RoomData])\n__________________________________________\nWill redefine valid property from base class Cell[T]\nAdds 'room within grid'- related methods like property(surrounded), break_wall\n \nWill use most of the \ndefault implementation of Cell[T]\nWill add property(surrounded), break_wall(w: Wall)\n-------------------------------------------------\n-------------------------------------------------\n+ property(valid): bool\n+ property(surrounded): list[T]\n+ break_wall(w: Wall): None\n+ property(is_exit): bool\n    return self._grid.exit == (self.y, self.x)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
